.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
An on/off switch. Stateless: the app owns \fBactive\fR.
.PP
\fBGtkSwitch\fR: a 46\(mu26 pill track with a 20px knob. The pill follows the theme's control radius (\fBradius_m\fR): fully round at the Adwaita default, square at 0.
.PP
iced's own \fBtoggler\fR is always 2:1 and sizes the knob from the height, which looks too wide next to Adwaita. This widget uses Adwaita's proportions.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
.B switch(active: bool)
